  "analysis": {
    "problem": "Chapter-local person hanshu:117:p241 cites personal-name witness [['s0151',[0]]], but s0151 Chinese is 「知隗囂終不寤，乃避墬於河西。」 with no 彪/班彪 surface—only an elided subject. That is not a primary Chinese named-person witness under native identity rules.",
    "namedPersonVerdict": "Ban Biao 班彪 is a genuinely named person in this chapter, but he is already represented by hanshu:117:p046 (囂問彪曰 at s0094; 彪 at s0094; 叔皮 at s0091) and hanshu:117:p218 (穉生彪 / 彪字叔皮 at s0079–s0080). p241 is a duplicate local shard with an incorrect name anchor, not a separate individual.",
    "primaryChineseWitnesses": [
      {
        "unitId": "s0079",
        "zh": "穉生彪。",
        "enLiteral": "Zhi begat Biao.",
        "enIdiomatic": "Ban Zhi was the father of Ban Biao.",
        "existingLocalPerson": "p218"
      },
      {
        "unitId": "s0080",
        "zh": "彪字叔皮，幼與從兄嗣共遊學，家有賜書，內足於財，好古之士自遠方至，父黨揚子雲以下莫不造門。",
        "enIdiomatic": "Ban Biao, styled Shuipi, studied abroad with his cousin Ban Si while the household enjoyed imperial book grants and deep coffers…",
        "existingLocalPerson": "p218"
      },
      {
        "unitId": "s0094",
        "zh": "囂問彪曰：「往者周亡，戰國並爭，天下分裂，數世然後乃定，其抑者從橫之事復起於今乎？",
        "enIdiomatic": "Wei Xiao asked Ban Biao, \"In former times when Zhou fell…",
        "existingLocalPerson": "p046"
      },
      {
        "unitId": "s0151",
        "zh": "知隗囂終不寤，乃避墬於河西。",
        "enIdiomatic": "Seeing that Wei Xiao would never see reason, Ban Biao crossed to the Hexi corridor beyond the Yellow River.",
        "witnessNote": "隗囂 is Wei Xiao (p240); subject is silent in Chinese. English supplies Ban Biao; must not back-annotate a zh personal-name span at s0151."
      },
      {
        "unitId": "s0158",
        "zh": "有子曰固，弱冠而孤，作幽通之賦，以致命遂志。",
        "enIdiomatic": "His son Ban Gu, orphaned at twenty, wrote the Rhapsody on Communicating with the Hidden…",
        "witnessNote": "Names son 固; father unnamed in Chinese; father–son link is narrative continuation to the same Ban Biao already named at s0094."
      }
    ],
    "repairStrategy": "Delete duplicate local person p241. Rebind every p241 mention/claim and cross-person reference to p046 (primary adult Ban Biao with Chinese 彪 witnesses). Preserve p218 genealogy row and all other approved people. Use narrative-subject attribution on s0151–s0157 without inventing a Chinese name span at s0151."
  },
